1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,510
[TA Sarah Jenkins] Slide 22 breaks down the Triad of Agentic Design. Every robust avatar must have these three components.

2
00:00:07,910 --> 00:00:23,010
[Prof. Peter Kim] Component 1 is the Memory Engine. Without memory, your agent forgets who you are every time it runs. We use structured markdown files like `SOUL.md` and vector banks so the agent retains your personal guidelines.

3
00:00:23,410 --> 00:00:33,870
[TA Sarah Jenkins] Component 2 is the Tool Belt. This is the collection of verified API endpoints, bash commands, and Apps Script functions the agent is authorized to call.

4
00:00:34,270 --> 00:00:49,750
[Prof. Peter Kim] And Component 3 is the Guardrail Matrix! You must never give an AI unlimited power. Guardrails define spending limits, prevent accidental file deletions, and require human approval for critical decisions.

5
00:00:50,150 --> 00:00:58,090
[TA Sarah Jenkins] Memory, Tools, and Guardrails. If you have all three, your avatar is safe, smart, and unstoppable!

